VISUAL: A ChatGPT interface showing the prompt "What tools has my team registered, and use one of them to list our Render services."
AUDIO: 'today. You can inspect the code and use it under the license, but this is not an unrestricted permissive license yet. There are practical limitations, too. A catalog can normalize discovery and'

[04:09] [scene:talk]
